WEBVTT

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.520
Don't let a single one escape!

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.220
You may kill anyone who resists!

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.790
Yasusuke-<i>sama.</i>

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.900
The light.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.200
This way.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.580
Wow!

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.600
No matter how many times
I look at it, what a wonderful potato!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.080
You...

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.270
That's as far as you go.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.930
Shit!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.770
All right! Kosode!

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.130
Yes!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.530
Hey, are you all right?

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.720
You're the guy from that time!

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:34.800
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:42.910
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:50.120
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:59.150
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:08.500
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:16.340
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:24.240
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:34.250
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.400
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:45.010
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:50.020
"HAKAMADARE"

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.750
What did that man do?

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:58.220
He banded with others and invaded the imperial storehouse.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.990
Such crimes have been increasing lately.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.320
Food, huh?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.890
And, it seems, harming others.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:08.830
No, don't charge him for this.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.270
But...

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.670
It's not much of a wound.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.190
Excuse me.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.770
You are injured...

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:20.670
No! I-It's fine. I'll do it myself.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.420
It seems these are done for.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.750
Yeah, it was an unforeseen event.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.120
It can't be helped.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.190
I will take care of that.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.430
Come to think of it, I never mentioned my name.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:40.090
I am Fujiwarano Yasusuke.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:43.600
This is my discharge, Kosode.

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.970
Discharge?

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:45.770
Yes.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:52.070
I received a documentation of innocence and work under Yasusuke-<i>sama,</i>

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:54.980
but I was originally imprisoned for the same crime as that man.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.210
I see.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.610
You must have had a hard life.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:03:59.650
Huh?

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:03.320
You're... a strange man.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.050
My name is Raiko.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:12.990
That gentleman... Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.730
He is a little similar to you.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.790
Hm? To me?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:23.000
Well, we must return to your brother soon.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.170
I'm sure the banquet will go on all night.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.940
It doesn't matter.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.500
Yasusuke-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.450
Kosode.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.750
This is for you.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:42.960
I am a discharge, someone who had committed a crime.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:48.330
I found this stone near the
Kamogawa river and polished it.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:53.470
Well, noble women don't let down their hair and use such things...

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.300
But I like that hairstyle of yours.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.280
Shit.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.480
If you don't like it, please throw it away.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.820
Yasusuke-<i>sama...</i>

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.050
Well! Though I don't feel like it, we should return...

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.400
That Raiko!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.560
He should have protected our food before protecting the peace!

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:36.540
Excuse me.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.010
Oh, how rare!

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:45.190
If you go down the path of thievery, you will not be able to return.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.320
What a rude little girl!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.360
I just want some rare things!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.730
That is what we call a thief.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.100
Well, that's true.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.430
No! No! No!

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.430
Are you hungry?

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:01.060
I'm not!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:08.610
I'm not!

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:13.350
This is delicious!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.550
This potato ball...

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:21.620
The harmony of this kneaded potato skin and crushed bean paste!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.260
That's all I have for you.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:25.890
This was originally not my potato.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.530
I want more of this potato! More!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.800
I don't have any more.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.270
Stingy!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:35.070
Now, I have to make the rest.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:42.540
H-Hey!

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:47.620
Though your clothes are plain, your hair ornament is quite beautiful.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:51.150
Beautiful, yet incomplete...

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:51.890
To me!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.120
Give it to me!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.460
I will prepare any number of more valuable things for you!

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.460
Do you wish for anything?

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.900
Wish for?! So you really aren't a thief?

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.260
I'm telling you that you're mistaken!

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.760
I'm begging you!

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.170
Please!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.130
If what you say is true...

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.940
...I will give you this hair ornament.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:25.250
My! The maples from Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.820
They are truly beautiful!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:31.290
Yes, such a beautiful color.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:35.260
He brought them down from
Ogura mountain in one day.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.200
A wonderful show of Michinaga-<i>sama</i>'s strength,

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:42.200
as well as his trust in Yasumasa-<i>chan</i>!

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:45.540
Is it not, Yorinobu-<i>chan</i>?

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.610
It is as you say.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.980
As you say!

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:52.540
Quite wonderful! Quite!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:08:01.620
You questioned Michinaga-<i>sama</i> in front of Kintou<i>-dono</i> a few days ago.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.560
He does nothing in response to the rise of crime

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:09.030
and the conflict at his home ended with no explanation.

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:12.670
You do not need to know.
Do not delve into such affairs.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:13.570
But, Brother!

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:20.140
Speaking of rumors, I hear you are getting close to your discharge.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:23.010
I hope that is not the case.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:27.580
It does not bother me that she is a discharge.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.420
I did not ask you about your feelings.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:34.420
The blood of the Fujiwara family runs through your veins.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.690
You understand what that means, right?

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.860
I will not allow any more gallivanting.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:50.130
Or will you become a criminal and bear your fangs at me?

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:02.120
So delicious!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:06.550
The perfect combination of kneaded potato skin and red bean paste!

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:09.190
Kosode used the potatoes that were crushed last night.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:11.390
She took it home and went through the trouble?!

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:14.600
True, such impressive skill...

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:15.900
Where is Kosode-<i>dono</i>?

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:19.300
She had a pressing engagement.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.970
I see. I wanted to thank her directly.

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.370
Don't worry about it.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.100
Actually, I came today to talk to you about something.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:34.310
I will prepare some tea.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:40.220
I am thinking of marrying Kosode.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.120
Wha...?! Are you serious?!

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.460
You are part of the police magistrate and Kosode is...

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.630
Well...

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.600
So you are the same as the others.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:55.470
I don't think that Kosode-<i>dono</i> is a bad person, it's just...

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.510
Then, it is no problem if
I become a criminal as well?

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.740
What?!

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.980
Don't think of doing stupid things, Yasusuke.

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:07.850
You are a person who leads criminals down the proper path.

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:12.790
Don't step off the path, but work to get Kosode<i>-dono</i> accepted by others!

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.160
Step off the path...

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.430
You are as straight as an arrow.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.100
But, Raiko, this is what I think.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.130
Looking at this capital,

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:29.200
I am beginning to believe that the criminals are the proper ones.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.320
Well?

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:47.050
I don't believe it.
You really were able to get this...

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:50.690
It's easy to obtain such things by charming an aristocrat here and there.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.990
Who are you?

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:58.700
They shiver in fear of evil spirits and lavishly party through the night.

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:02.140
They're a gathering of cowardly scum.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.810
Even so, I dream of having a higher status.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:07.740
I dream of wearing a summer kimono.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.870
Is that how it is?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.720
Seimei-<i>sama.</i>

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.310
Sit proudly.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:34.420
Please stop. This is enough.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:39.170
Was that really enough?

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.370
Yes.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:44.950
I am not suited for such things, after all.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.610
Are you in love with an aristocrat?

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:52.520
The one who gave me that hair ornament

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.350
is the police official that captured me.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:59.260
So that you forget...

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:02.890
No, you're letting it go to make him forget.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.470
I won't have you ask for it back later.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:16.400
He has given me something much more valuable than a hair ornament.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:43.300
It was dangerous today.

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.860
That's enough.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.430
We cannot!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.240
Kosode. With you, I...

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.800
Yasusuke-<i>sama.</i>

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.970
I would like to be let go.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:01.450
What do you mean?!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.820
It is just as I said.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:06.950
I cannot be together with you any longer, Yasusuke-<i>sama.</i>

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:08.290
Tell me the reason!

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.660
You are a man who must carry the Fujiwara name.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:11.890
I told you!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.660
I don't care about the Fujiwara family.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:15.330
Why don't you understand?!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:19.800
We became criminals because we didn't have any other choice!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:23.340
You want to step down from the good life you were born to?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:28.240
Who wants to be with a fool that doesn't know the meaning of his actions?!

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.510
Kosode!

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.650
Where is the hair ornament?!

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:34.670
I don't need it.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:42.360
Every day, the people around us die of hunger!

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.190
Don't say you don't know!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:47.090
Even so, crimes must be punished!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.030
The justice you speak of...

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:51.120
I don't need it!

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.030
Kosode.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:02.340
Kintoki said we won't have dinner until you come back.

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.210
Yeah.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:06.980
Your face looks like a rice cracker soggy from the rain!

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:10.150
Seimei, I'm a bit troubled.

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:12.650
And I'm hungry!

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:14.450
I'll listen, so hurry up and come in.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.730
Who is it?

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:30.540
Yasusuke-<i>dono.</i>

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:36.740
I will give up my name and status.

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:38.680
What are you saying?!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.580
You have your duty as a Fujiwara to uphold.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.080
And what is that duty?

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:48.090
You already know. You must work for the sake of the capital.

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:50.490
And who is this capital for?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.830
Is it for the people who live here or for Michinaga-<i>sama</i>?

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.660
Our lord has his own way of thinking.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.500
There are people who must commit crimes

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.900
because the Light Palace turns a blind eye to them!

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.670
Stop this, Yasusuke-<i>dono</i>!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.910
Yasumasa-<i>sama</i>! Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.170
Stand down.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.380
I would rather walk down the path of a criminal,

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.710
than support the Light Palace as it is now!

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.880
Embarrassment of the Fujiwara family.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.120
Your words can no longer pass as mere jest!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.550
It was never jest.

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.850
You cannot! I will take him!

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.270
What are you doing?!

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:34.740
You thief!

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:39.140
Huh? N-No! I was just...

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.740
Leave them alone.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:43.410
It's not your problem.

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.980
Don't joke around, Seimei!

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.380
I'm serious.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.750
I know more about this situation than you think.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.380
What do you mean?

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:57.720
Yasusuke-<i>dono</i>, you currently lack composure!

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.730
No matter how much they struggle.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.970
Those two can never be together.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:08.140
Why?! If they both have feelings for one another...

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:09.300
It's impossible!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:12.740
There are things that can and can't be done!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:17.530
This cloth isn't something that someone like you deserves to touch!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.250
Why? How are we so different?!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:25.620
From the moment they were born, everything has been different.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:28.360
I can't accept something like that!

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:31.790
You cannot save all people.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.030
Don't be so cocky.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:36.930
This roll of cloth is covered in mud!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.930
It's ruined!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.200
Throw it away.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:44.470
Yes! Away!

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:48.610
I dislike even looking at filthy things, they taint the eyes.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:55.150
F-Filthy? I'm filthy?

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:58.150
I wonder who the truly filthy ones are?

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.490
What?!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:04.690
You are all filthier and more tainted than I...

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.790
No matter how you try to adorn yourself!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.290
You!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.570
Wh-What happened?!

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:27.480
Fine! I will give you cloth or whatever you want!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.250
Ugly. Ugly.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.190
Why does someone like you wear such pretty clothes?

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:51.110
I have taken care of things this time.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.080
You are still my little brother,

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.340
but understand there will not be a next time!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:06.920
It seems a Horror appeared last night.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.260
What are its characteristics?

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:11.590
Only an aristocrat's daughter was attacked.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.930
It was a monster wrapped in a summer kimono.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.880
Look at me.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.280
I can't do anything the way I am now.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:40.650
But, I can't just give up!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:42.960
Someone! Someone call Yasumasa-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:43.960
What's wrong?!

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:47.920
Th-Th-They've been stolen!!

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.060
Yasusuke!

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:08.480
Kosode-<i>dono</i>?!

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:20.590
Kosode.

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:29.600
Ugly! Ugly!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.440
Why, Kosode-<i>dono</i>?!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.370
That is no longer Kosode!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:34.840
Don't be tricked!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.610
Shit. Seimei!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:02.800
Seimei!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.390
Don't worry about me!
Hurry and attack the main body!

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:18.390
I have a <i>shiki</i> doll between my breasts! Take it!

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:19.280
Huh? You sure?!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.550
Hurry!

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.250
Throw it at the Horror!

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.610
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:51.680
I'm sorry, Yasusuke...

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.720
Every single person.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:21:01.200
I told you. It's impossible to protect everyone.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:05.030
Even so, I won't give up.
I'm a Makai Knight, after all.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:10.740
Those feelings of yours are what's important, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:24.550
Leave all your possessions behind!
I will not take your life!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.790
Wh-Who are you?

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:28.990
The clothes of the police magistrate?

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:31.830
Your name! Tell me your name!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:34.260
My name?

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:35.400
You have no name?

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:40.730
I lost my parents when I was a babe and lived on my own until now.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:44.170
I see. Then, I'll give you a name.

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:46.640
Even your sleeves are in tatters...

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:53.250
Tattered sleeves. Kosode! I'll call you Kosode!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.310
How about it?

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:59.420
Kosode. My name...

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.650
You don't like it?

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:05.180
No, I will treasure it all my life.

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.260
My name...

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:16.300
Then, call me the thief, Hakamadare!

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:38.030
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:45.000
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:52.170
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:59.080
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:02.680
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:06.150
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.260
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:11.890
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:16.560
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:23.570
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:30.040
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:37.280
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.590
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:48.290
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:51.030 --> 00:24:01.040
"Next Episode: LURKING DEMON"

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:54.020
Parents think of their children.

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:56.690
Children know not their parents' heart.

00:23:56.690 --> 00:24:00.790
And silently comes the darkness.
